      "x": 24430,
      "y": 0,
      "theme": {
        "admin:Mode": "Dark"
      },
      "context": "/ (requireStaffSession + overview:read) — Operations centre for staff, drawn after the admin prototype: glass bento tiles over the aurora — what needs action first, then KPIs, listens, the track pipeline, reports by type, accounts and the audit trail. Every tile opens its analysis. The sidebar footer switches the language (English ↔ Українська), cycles the theme (Dark → Light → Dim) and collapses the panel to a rail. Not-found is not a state of this page: unknown admin addresses open the 404 page (not-found/not-found.pen). Overlays (bell, profile menu, command palette, menu) are drawn in the flow under the top bar; the prototype shows them floating."
    },
